Hey, Noam.  That IS a nice example, but it's worth mentioning that the
"pipe" operator (which Hadley pronounces something like "the-in"
["then"]) is actually part of the "magrittr" package.  I.e., dplyr
makes effective use of the concept, but you don't have to use dplyr to
benefit from it.

-- Mike

